          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 12 2026 19:24:03 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">In a non-clinical two-sample t-test, compared to Oxinium Legion (Oxidized Zr-2.5Nb), Triathlon Gold’s TiN-coated Ti6Al4V demonstrated <b>superior scratch resistance</b>.<sup>14</sup></span></p>\n",
